<title>USA: Pic 'N Pay Stores Inc bankruptcy plan confirmed.</title>
<headline>Pic 'N Pay Stores Inc bankruptcy plan confirmed.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pic 'N Pay Stores Inc, a privately held company, said on Thursday that a U.S. bankruptcy court has confirmed its reorganization plan.</p>
<p>The court, in Wilmington, Del., set February 23, 1997, as the effective date of the plan.</p>
<p>Pic 'N Pay is a footwear and accessories retailer.</p>
</text>
